id: DRAFT-kjobwidgets-solid-ohos-elf-runtime-contract
draft: true
contributor_id: zxyAtom
title: OHOS Conan/CMake 共享库的 SONAME、DT_NEEDED、运行库 staging 与 ELF 签名闭环
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|clang|ld|readelf|binary-sign-tool
phase: linking|packaging|runtime|testing
error_signature: missing DT_SONAME|DT_NEEDED.*\.conan2/p/|IMPORTED_NO_SONAME|Error loading shared library.*libKF6
severity: 1
category: ohos|cmake|conan|linking|packaging
match_keywords: SONAME, DT_SONAME, DT_NEEDED, IMPORTED_NO_SONAME, binary-sign-tool, codesign, runtime staging, OHOS loader
root_cause: OHOS 动态库若缺少稳定 SONAME 或携带 Conan 缓存绝对 DT_NEEDED，且运行时副本未在实际执行目录重新签名，消费者即使完成编译和链接也会在加载阶段失败。
affected_scope: OHOS aarch64 Conan/CMake KF6 共享库及其动态消费者；已切换到 qtbase-sql-dbus/6.11.1（FEATURE_dbus=ON，依赖 dbus/1.14.10）
verification_cmd: llvm-readelf -d <library>; llvm-readelf -S <library>; run consumer under the staged runtime directory
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: ohos-private-runtime-closure
rec_description: 在任务私有产物中设置 SONAME，规范化绝对 DT_NEEDED，实体化消费者所需运行库，并在执行前移除旧 codesign 后重新签名；不得修改 Conan 缓存。
rec_command:
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl:
forbid_1_pattern: only-set-LD_LIBRARY_PATH-or-RPATH-without-signing
forbid_1_reason: OHOS loader 可能仍拒绝运行时 ELF，或无法解析 staged SONAME 依赖。
forbid_1_consequence: consumer 以 Error loading shared library 或 RC 127 退出。
principles: P017
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to: E537,E077,E452
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-kjobwidgets-solid-ohos-elf-runtime-contract.md
last_updated: 2026-09-07
source_event: KJobWidgets 6.18.0 PR #7389 与 Solid 6.18.0 PR #7390 的 OHOS CI 失败矩阵及最终通过记录
authors: zxyAtom
source_pr: "#7389"
